# 2026-11-24 macOS multi-window probe — transcript
# Host: macOS (aarch64), real winit windows, no accessibility/screen-recording grants.
# Driven by rune --window-script (replays input on the wall clock into real windows).
# Window evidence: CGWindowListCopyWindowInfo via swift (no permissions needed).

